    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CONNIE: You must know your way around the estate better than I do.\nLILY: Oh no, m’lady - I couldn’t visit while my mother was working.\nCONNIE: In that case we’ll have to learn our way around together then, won’t we, Lily?",
      "HILDA: Connie? It’s me.\nCONNIE: Hilda! You came!\nHILDA: What on earth are you doing? What is all this?\nCONNIE: Nothing. I wanted a change, is all.",
      "CONNIE: That isn’t necessary. Thank you. Good day, Mrs. Flint.\nMRS. FLINT: Do come again!",
      "CONNIE: Hilda! Oh, it’s so good to see you!\nHILDA: It’s been too long.\nCONNIE: I have so much to tell you.\nHILDA: So it would seem.",
      "CONNIE: Hilda.\nHILDA: What do you want me to say?"
    ]
  },
